      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "PC Troubleshooting",
      "heading": "Method 4: Repair System Files",
      "body": "A damaged system file can block Windows Update. Windows includes two repair tools: DISM and System File Checker.",
      "durationInFrames": 307
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "PC Troubleshooting",
      "heading": "Method 5: Date, Time, and Network",
      "body": "Windows Update needs a correct system date and time. A VPN or proxy can also block the connection.",
      "durationInFrames": 319
    },
